import{_ as t,o as n,c as i,a2 as s}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 861 | Transcended Ones and Culture · Overview — The Transcended One's Cultural Construction","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 861 | Transcended Ones and Culture · Overview — The Transcended One's Cultural Construction","no":861,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Culture","Cultural Construction","Myriad-Rank Culture","Symbiotic Culture"],"related":["52-Alien-Race Classification and Symbiosis","847-Civilizational Aesthetics","862-Myriad-Rank Cultural Intermingling and Protection","863-Symbiotic-Culture Creation and Dissemination"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0861_模块4-超脱者与文化-总论.md","filePath":"en/0861_模块4-超脱者与文化-总论.md"}`),r={name:"en/0861_模块4-超脱者与文化-总论.md"};function a(o,e,l,u,c,d){return n(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[s('<h1 id="entry-861-transcended-ones-and-culture-·-overview-—-the-transcended-one-s-cultural-construction" tabindex="-1">Entry 861 | Transcended Ones and Culture · Overview — The Transcended One&#39;s Cultural Construction <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-861-transcended-ones-and-culture-·-overview-—-the-transcended-one-s-cultural-construction" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 861 | Transcended Ones and Culture · Overview — The Transcended One&#39;s Cultural Construction&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 52, 847, 862, 863</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-institutions-govern-behavior-culture-governs-hearts-and-minds" tabindex="-1">Introduction: institutions govern behavior; culture governs hearts and minds <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-institutions-govern-behavior-culture-governs-hearts-and-minds" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: institutions govern behavior; culture governs hearts and minds&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Laws and institutions may constrain what Myriad Ranks &quot;do not do,&quot; yet cannot make Myriad Ranks &quot;want to do.&quot; What truly determines a civilization&#39;s temperament is its culture — what it believes, celebrates, fears, aspires to. The old world&#39;s strong ones are busy legislating and contending for hegemony, never minding culture; so Myriad Ranks obey law on the lips, yet still believe in hearts &quot;the strong predating is a matter of course.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s transcended one understands: <strong>only changing institutions without changing culture, institutions will eventually be hollowed out by hearts.</strong> This entry is the &quot;Transcended Ones and Culture&quot; sub-theme overview, explaining why the transcended one must personally build culture, and how his cultural construction differs from the old world&#39;s &quot;strong ones making culture.&quot;</p><p>Six top-level axioms centrally fulfill <strong>the republican axiom of Myriad Races</strong>: culture is jointly created and enjoyed by Myriad Ranks; <strong>the anti-predation axiom</strong> requires culture not be used to inculcate predatory rhetoric; <strong>the collective ascension axiom</strong> requires culture nourish Myriad Ranks&#39; common upward movement; <strong>the causal self-discipline axiom</strong> requires cultural dissemination not manipulate hearts; <strong>the law-first axiom</strong> requires culture be self-consistent with the charter.</p><p>Among them, <strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong> is the sixth pillar: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. The old cosmos&#39; resources and Great Dao are limited, necessarily leading to predatory involution; the Anchor Symbiotic everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-why-culture-is-the-transcended-one-s-real-business" tabindex="-1">I. Why Culture Is the Transcended One&#39;s Real Business <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-why-culture-is-the-transcended-one-s-real-business" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Why Culture Is the Transcended One&#39;s Real Business&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Culture is not &quot;intangible&quot;; it is civilization&#39;s operating system:</p><ul><li>It determines how Myriad Ranks behave when no one supervises — institutions cannot govern every corner, culture does;</li><li>It determines what the next generation grows into — children grow up in culture, values are set;</li><li>It determines which way civilization goes in crisis — at crisis moments, institutions fail, culture saves the day.</li></ul><p>If the transcended one does not mind culture, he is leaving &quot;hearts,&quot; this most important battlefield, to the old world&#39;s predatory rhetoric to occupy.</p><h2 id="ii-the-transcended-one-s-cultural-construction-has-three-facets" tabindex="-1">II. The Transcended One&#39;s Cultural Construction Has Three Facets <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-transcended-one-s-cultural-construction-has-three-facets" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Transcended One&#39;s Cultural Construction Has Three Facets&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This overview leads the following three facets:</p><ul><li><strong>Myriad-Rank cultural intermingling and protection</strong> (entry 862): respect each clan&#39;s unique culture, while letting them intermingle, not forcing assimilation;</li><li><strong>Symbiotic culture&#39;s creation and dissemination</strong> (entry 863): distill the five axioms into a new culture Myriad Ranks may feel, and spread it;</li><li><strong>Cultural-diversity law guarantee</strong> (entry 865): use law-level institutions to protect cultural diversity, preventing single-culture hegemony.</li></ul><p>Three facets together: <strong>protect diversity, create symbiosis, use laws as backstop.</strong></p><h2 id="iii-cultural-construction-is-not-reforming-myriad-ranks" tabindex="-1">III. Cultural Construction Is Not &quot;Reforming Myriad Ranks&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-cultural-construction-is-not-reforming-myriad-ranks" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Cultural Construction Is Not &quot;Reforming Myriad Ranks&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one building culture must be wary of one slip — turning &quot;building culture&quot; into &quot;reforming Myriad Ranks&quot;:</p><ul><li>Do not force Myriad Ranks to abandon their own traditions (protection first);</li><li>Do not turn symbiotic culture into &quot;the only correct culture&quot; imposed on others (diversity coexists);</li><li>The transcended one is culture&#39;s &quot;nourisher&quot; and &quot;exemplar,&quot; not culture&#39;s &quot;dictator.&quot;</li></ul><p>This is in the same lineage as entry 847&#39;s &quot;beauty may be led, may not be monopolized.&quot; <strong>Cultural construction is setting the stage, not singing for Myriad Ranks.</strong></p><h2 id="iv-culture-s-relationship-to-civilizational-aesthetics-and-epics" tabindex="-1">IV. Culture&#39;s Relationship to Civilizational Aesthetics and Epics <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-culture-s-relationship-to-civilizational-aesthetics-and-epics" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Culture&#39;s Relationship to Civilizational Aesthetics and Epics&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Cultural construction is not isolated; it tightly meshes with the art series discussed earlier:</p><ul><li>Civilizational aesthetics (entry 847) sets culture&#39;s direction;</li><li>Epic (entry 848) casts culture&#39;s narrative;</li><li>Consciousness art (entry 849) nurtures culture&#39;s heart-nature;</li><li>Cultural construction then condenses these into Myriad Ranks&#39; daily customs, festivals, identity.</li></ul><p>Art is the vanguard; culture is the soil.</p><p>Cultural construction in the transcended one&#39;s post sequence is often misunderstood as &quot;not doing proper work&quot; — it cannot directly fight monsters and level up, nor immediately produce energy. But its civilizational weight is not low: if a plane&#39;s cultural consensus collapses, however precise the law network and unobstructed the energy circulation, it will disintegrate from within. Historically, multiple predatory-school planes&#39; destruction was not defeated by external force, but first lost their common cultural narrative; the strong each harbored their own schemes, the bottom&#39;s hearts scattered, the whole system split into fragments from within. The transcended one investing in cultural construction is essentially buying &quot;internal unity insurance&quot; for civilization. This investment has no visible short-term return, but long-term is the hardest national defense.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: organize Myriad Ranks&#39; spiritual needs, preventing the hearts battlefield from being occupied by predatory rhetoric</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: cultural construction is anti-predation from the heart layer, more root-cure than law</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style strong ones only legislate and contend for hegemony, ignore culture; hearts still believe in predation; Heng Yuan Zhou lists cultural construction as the transcended one&#39;s duty</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: culture faces all five-lineage clans, respecting their traditions</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: cultural construction&#39;s principles, results, and guarantee mechanism all public network-wide</li></ul><h2 id="supplement-cultural-construction-s-post-and-weight" tabindex="-1">Supplement: Cultural Construction&#39;s Post and Weight <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplement-cultural-construction-s-post-and-weight" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplement: Cultural Construction&#39;s Post and Weight&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Cultural construction is the transcended one&#39;s real business, therefore also a post. His effect in protecting diversity, creating symbiosis, and guiding aesthetics is counted into civilizational weight by the actual improvement in Myriad Ranks&#39; spiritual outlook. Anomalies in the cultural field — predatory rhetoric spreading, some clan&#39;s culture discriminated against — are captured by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision, triggering the transcended one&#39;s intervention. When the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm also brings the &quot;hearts&quot; battlefield into construction and supervision, Myriad Ranks are not only constrained by institutions, but nourished by culture. Institutions govern behavior; culture governs hearts; the two together, civilization truly has a soul.</p><p>Cultural construction must also catch Axiom 6&#39;s deep meaning: since everyone inherently possesses basic infinity and even layabouts have a floor, culture should not only glorify strivers and strong ones, but also make easygoing beings feel respected, not eliminated by the times.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Institutions govern behavior; culture governs hearts and minds. The transcended one&#39;s cultural construction turns &quot;anti-predation&quot; and &quot;Myriad-Rank republicanism&quot; from words on the wall into things Myriad Ranks believe in daily. It protects diversity, creates symbiosis, uses laws as backstop, letting culture not be a discipline imposed by a dictator, but soil in which Myriad Ranks jointly grow. When the hearts battlefield is nourished by symbiotic culture, institutions will not be hollowed out, and civilization truly has a soul.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/52-异族分类与共生.html">Entry 52 · Alien-Race Classification and Symbiosis</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/847_模块4-超脱者与艺术-文明美学.html">Entry 847 · Civilizational Aesthetics</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/862_模块4-超脱者与文化-万族文化交融与保护.html">Entry 862 · Myriad-Rank Cultural Intermingling and Protection</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/863_模块4-超脱者与文化-共生文化创造与传播.html">Entry 863 · Symbiotic-Culture Creation and Dissemination</a></li></ul>',33)])])}const m=t(r,[["render",a]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
